# Residenzbrunnen (Residenzplatz): the tiered baroque fountain. Basin with
# a plain curved wall, a rock base with two sea horses bursting out and three
# Atlantes holding up the big bowl, a small bowl on top with the Triton
# blowing a jet of water from his conch. Light stone w/i/m (rock m with
# i/d; figures separated by d lines), water t/T/w spilling over the big bowl
# all round, k outline.
# Drawn over the 5x3 solid fountain tiles: the bowl lip at y=16 is the top
# of the tile block (rows 16-63 = the 80x48 block, fully opaque), Triton +
# jet above it. idle: 2 frames, the water streaks and the jet move.
sprite = residenzbrunnen
size   = 80x64
origin = 40,64
anim   = idle frames=2 ticks=12 loop
